NetworkModule - WiFi and MQTT for PlaceNet-Beacon

This module provides WiFi connectivity and MQTT publish/subscribe functionality
for ESP32-S3 based PlaceNet-Beacon devices.

Features:
- WiFi STA mode connection with automatic reconnection
- MQTT client with authentication support
- Message callback system for handling incoming MQTT messages
- Event-driven connection status tracking
- Thread-safe event groups for status monitoring

Usage:
1. Initialize WiFi connection
2. Initialize MQTT broker connection (optional authentication)
3. Subscribe to topics and set message callback
4. Call loop() periodically to maintain connections
5. Publish messages as needed

See examples in src/tasks/network_task.cpp
